# hostd's flags on the Mac appliance (nix/hosts/mac.nix, DECISIONS I-1494).
# The api over the hub (I-1382): the control plane's WireGuard address,
# its internal name, the platform host CA (nix/hosts/platform.nix).
HOSTD_API_ARGS=--api-addr 10.255.255.1:8443 --api-server-name api.repose.herakraft.co --api-ca /etc/repose/api-ca.pem
# Snapshots on its own disk (I-1372); the ready and phase windows measured
# on the M4 (I-1376, I-1408); the park through the launcher's keychain
# key (I-1386), its deadline under the launcher's 330 s grace. The Mac is
# its user's own: guests share its memory and every vCPU (I-1626, I-1628).
HOSTD_ARGS=--owned-host --snapshot-dir /var/lib/repose/snapshots --ready-timeout 5m --paths-timeout 10m --setup-timeout 10m --park --park-deadline 120s --park-write-rate 100 --park-restore-timeout 180s --park-key-vsock 1386 --free-page-reporting
